        237,
        1227,
        1057,
        1327
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a7 2. The Commission shall prepare a report, to be submitted to the Mayor by October 1, 1969, which is to include, but not be limited to, studies and recommendations in the following areas:",
      "logprob_stats": {
